OL,3,GNEWSAParents struggling to find schools
OL,4,Athat meet SEND children's needs
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents across Yorkshire are starting
OL,7,Fto get ready for the new academic year,
OL,8,Fchoosing uniforms and picking out
OL,9,Fpencil cases.
OL,11,FHowever, for some families the
OL,12,Fchallenge is more difficult; finding a
OL,13,Fschool that can safely meet their
OL,14,Fdisabled child's needs.
