OL,3,GNEWSAParents struggling to find schools
OL,4,Athat meet SEND children's needs
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemand for Education, Health and Care
OL,7,FPlans (EHCPs), which are designed to
OL,8,Fsupport children and young people with
OL,9,Fspecial educational needs and
OL,10,Fdisabilities (SEND), has more than
OL,11,Fdoubled across Yorkshire, rising from
OL,12,F5,944 requests in 2019 to 14,041 in
OL,13,F2025, according to the Department for
OL,14,FEducation, external.
OL,16,FEHCPs set out the extra support a child
OL,17,Frequires in education, including
OL,18,Fspecialist provision where needed.
